Z||000009||mrfiero||01-05-2001||04:02 AM||||Terry,<P>If you could get to Modesto I would REALLY appreciate it.  Thanks.<P>I am still looking for the stuff you need, but I'll get it.<P>Standard,<P>The '84 control arms are different, but the '85-'87's were the same (as far as I know).||||reg||1
